WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.585
Every BxAgents project can ship its own chat page.

00:00:03.905 --> 00:00:08.364
This is the web UI of an Acme support agent, built from one gateway file.

00:00:08.684 --> 00:00:11.607
It starts at sign in, with accounts you declare in code.

00:00:12.208 --> 00:00:14.320
Signed in, you land in a clean chat.

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:21.467
The header shows the agent, the model picker, and icon buttons for your conversations, notes, an API key and the theme.

00:00:21.787 --> 00:00:23.557
Hover any of them for its name.

00:00:24.794 --> 00:00:29.807
Ask a question and the answer streams in as it is written, with Markdown formatting and lists.

00:00:33.498 --> 00:00:36.570
The model picker lists the profiles the app chose to offer.

00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:42.181
Pick the planner profile, and the next answer comes from a different model, in the same conversation.

00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:48.988
When the agent calls a tool, the page shows it as a block you can open, with the tool's name and what it was called with.

00:00:49.589 --> 00:00:52.448
The ring in the header fills as the conversation grows.

00:00:52.768 --> 00:01:01.152
Click it for the breakdown: the system prompt, the tool definitions, the notes and the messages, each with its size, and a button to compact the conversation.

00:01:01.752 --> 00:01:03.501
Type a slash for the commands.

00:01:03.821 --> 00:01:08.984
The menu lists each one with a hint, and the lightning button next to the message box opens it too.

00:01:09.584 --> 00:01:11.397
Every conversation is saved.

00:01:11.717 --> 00:01:15.579
Start a new chat, and the old one stays in the list, ready to open again.

00:01:16.178 --> 00:01:18.823
Notes keep what the agent should remember about you.

00:01:19.143 --> 00:01:21.106
Add one, and it is there next time.

00:01:21.706 --> 00:01:24.970
Dark mode is one click, and the page remembers your choice.

00:01:25.569 --> 00:01:34.657
That is the whole web UI: sign in, streaming answers, a model picker you control, tools, the context breakdown, commands, saved conversations, notes and themes.

00:01:34.977 --> 00:01:37.857
All from a few lines of YAML and one gateway file.
